A WORD ON THE WARRANTY DISCLAIMER
================================================================================

Read that last paragraph as meant. This software loads kernel modules, resets
PCI devices, places kprobes at hard-coded offsets inside a proprietary driver,
and writes to sysfs. During development it wedged a GPU, oopsed the host more
than once, and needed a physical power cycle. It is an unsupported
configuration on hardware the vendor does not intend it for.

If it breaks your machine, that is your risk. Read docs/TUTORIAL.md Part 11
before you run anything.
